mothershipOS: each --v4l2-proxy device gets a resource bridge to the GPU and resolves the virtio objects of DMABUF
buffers (virtio-media patch 0003) to the host DMABUF of the virtio-gpu resource (crosvm's virtio-gpu UUIDs carry
the resource ID in their last 4 bytes, big endian). The guest can then decode/capture straight into its gralloc
buffers: zero copy from the host's Venus decoder to the guest's display.

